nitial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=-3x.\n$$" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343190 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343191 13194139535311 true] [17592186343190 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343192 13194139535311 true] [17592186343190 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343193 13194139535311 true] [17592186343190 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343194 13194139535311 true] [17592186343190 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343195 13194139535311 true] [17592186343190 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535311 true] [17592186343190 1041 "selection" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343190 1104 #edb/ref 17592186343193 13194139535311 true] [17592186343190 1110 #uuid "e09e87c1-7fa9-5e7e-867d-2744524684a6" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343191 1034 "3" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343191 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535311 true] [17592186343191 1111 #uuid "04f7c9cb-03bb-5f4a-bc2c-dac592eecf5a" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343192 1034 "1" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343192 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535311 true] [17592186343192 1111 #uuid "c7d131b7-f132-532b-9637-35c5693ffaad" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343193 1034 "-3" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343193 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535311 true] [17592186343193 1111 #uuid "57167bc3-7525-5a98-8e9c-f60d49407684" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343194 1034 "-1" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343194 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535311 true] [17592186343194 1111 #uuid "aa80debc-bf73-5dee-b7f3-16746495d52f" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343195 1034 "-6" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343195 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535311 true] [17592186343195 1111 #uuid "0ff10567-e99b-581f-9a5c-3d8134aec462" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343196 1017 #edb/ref 17592186343197 13194139535311 true] [17592186343196 1089 "q-352654" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343196 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535311 true] [17592186343196 1100 "Consider the following initial value problem\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=3y,\\,y(2)=5.\n$$\n\nYou're given that $y=A{e}^{3x}$ is the solution to this initial value problem. What is the value of the constant $A?$\n\n$A=${{field-1}}" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343196 1113 #uuid "234ff426-43d9-539a-9bed-18f994374c5b" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343196 1145 "We're given that $y=A{e}^{3x}$ is the solution to the initial value problem. Therefore, it must satisfy the differential equation *and* the initial condition $y(2)=5.$\n\nSubstituting the initial condition $y(2)=5$ into our solution and solving for $A,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =A{e}^{3x} \\\\ 5 & =A{e}^{3\\cdot 2} \\\\ 5 & =A{e}^{6} \\\\ \\frac{5}{{e}^{6}} & =A \\\\ A & =\\frac{5}{{e}^{6}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343197 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343198 13194139535311 true] [17592186343197 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535311 true] [17592186343197 1041 "field-1" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343197 1104 #edb/ref 17592186343198 13194139535311 true] [17592186343197 1110 #uuid "98285775-a9fb-56b7-be3d-393fa624d3e8" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343198 1034 "5e^{-6}" 13194139535311 true] [17592186343198 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535311 true] [17592186343198 1111 #uuid "e46a7ae1-4011-5704-af42-e13cf11c2581" 13194139535311 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-141113" 17592186343182 "q-141113/selection" 17592186343183 "q-141113/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" 17592186343184 "q-141113/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" 17592186343185 "q-141113/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" 17592186343186 "q-141113/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" 17592186343187 "q-141113/selection/e53026d2e72b5a9665afb169ba986753fff36dfc4557e460320cb8d9594cece8" 17592186343188 "q-141114" 17592186343189 "q-141114/selection" 17592186343190 "q-141114/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" 17592186343191 "q-141114/selection/ad06f